  "description": "⭐<em>Don't just watch the film. </em><strong><em>Taste it.</em></strong><br>\r\n<em>A bespoke cinematic dining experience where iconic film moments come straight to your table as they appear on screen,&nbsp;course by delicious course.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!<br>\r\n🥞 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Pulp Fiction (1994)<br>\r\n🍴 Burgers, shakes and an adrenaline shot. It’s a taste of real Americana with added Taste Film vibes. You’ll be transported into our diner, where the substances are all legal - and delicious. Just watch out for that couple in the corner.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date: September &amp; October 2026<br>\r\n🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.<br>\r\n📍 Location: The Refinery Citypoint, EC2Y 9HT<br>\r\n👤 Age rating: this film is rated <a href=\"https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/pulp-fiction-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0zmdgwotc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">18</a><br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gw4145F6lirZQe2o3E9A7ttpev1C0u29/view?usp=drive_link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nWE DARE YA!<br>\r\nIt’s time to twist, shout, and dine like it’s 1994.&nbsp;<br>\r\nWe’re bringing back a Tarantino cult classic that’s chaotic, tense and seriously gourmet.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIn Pulp Fiction, a burger isn't just a burger and a milkshake isn't just a milkshake. They're some of the most iconic props in modern cinema. From Hawaiian burgers and five dollar shakes to greasy spoon breakfasts and late night diners, Tarantino transformed everyday meals into moments we all want to taste.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nJust like the film, this menu is a little non-linear. Keep up, it’s *cinema* It’s a limited-edition run of a fan-favourite, so be prepared for a race for the tickets!",
